Issue 2 
==========================

kubectl get deployment -n kube-system aws-load-balancer-controller
NAME                           READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
aws-load-balancer-controller   0/2     2            0           12m

No nodes getting provisioned 

this was because the serive account (load balancer) was not getting created properly 

Deployment: 0/2 Ready, 0 pods created
ReplicaFailure: True, FailedCreate

How it was identified 

1	kubectl get pods -n kube-system -l app.kubernetes.io/name=aws-load-balancer-controller	---- No pods found at all
2	kubectl describe deployment aws-load-balancer-controller -n kube-system	---- ReplicaFailure: True, FailedCreate
3	kubectl describe replicaset aws-load-balancer-controller-854dd5475c -n kube-system	---- Root cause: serviceaccount "aws-load-balancer-controller" not found

Root Cause:
================

The Helm chart was installed with --set serviceAccount.create=false, which tells Helm to not create the ServiceAccount — expecting it to already exist. But it didn't.

Why eksctl create iamserviceaccount didn't create it:

The IAM role AmazonEKSLoadBalancerControllerRole already existed (from the previous cluster)
eksctl saw the existing CloudFormation stack and said "no tasks" — skipping ServiceAccount creation
Result: IAM role ✅ exists | Kubernetes ServiceAccount ❌ missing

How We Fixed It
================

1. Manually created the ServiceAccount

kubectl create serviceaccount aws-load-balancer-controller -n kube-system
2. Annotated it with the IAM role ARN

kubectl annotate serviceaccount aws-load-balancer-controller -n kube-system \
  eks.amazonaws.com/role-arn=arn:aws:iam::307946644949:role/AmazonEKSLoadBalancerControllerRole
3. Restarted the deployment (ReplicaSet was in failure backoff)

kubectl rollout restart deployment aws-load-balancer-controller -n kube-system
4. Verified

kubectl get deployment -n kube-system aws-load-balancer-controller
NAME                           READY   UP-TO-DATE   AVAILABLE   AGE
aws-load-balancer-controller   2/2     2            2           12m

